 "note": "One-sided defense. The base sits on the left (the player half of mvp_mirrored_01 without the gun turrets, SAM sites and helipads): two wall lines with eight-cell openings at rows 6-13 and a pillbox at each end of the brick opening. Three defense points form an arc in front of the opening. Three entries sit 14 to 17 cells beyond the wall so that infantry (about 1.3 cells/s) reach their defense point in 9 to 12 s and jeeps in 3 to 4 s. Entry names match the authored waves: left is the top lane, right the bottom lane. Later levels add defenses through battlefield variants.",
